# InfEngine modifications to Apache-2.0 upstream source; see NOTICE and third_party/.
From: infengine control-plane
Subject: [PATCH] vLLM runtime scheduler-policy control (v0.28.0) - Control Contract V1

Allowlisted runtime scheduler policies, bounded by provisioned boot capacity,
touching only the live scheduler operating state (never worker buffers, KV
allocation, CUDA-graph capture, or compilation):
  long_prefill_token_threshold, runtime_max_running_seqs,
  runtime_max_scheduled_tokens, runtime_kv_watermark,
  runtime_reserve_full_isl
plus get_runtime_cache_stats (prefix-cache observable) for operation
verification and the DRAIN transport (pause_generation/resume_generation/
reset_prefix_cache).

Generated from the actual pristine-vs-patched v0.28.0 diff.

